WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The image is still.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Look gently near the dot, not at the patch. Optional: do not strain.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Some viewers report fading. This artist's patch is animated.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The physical patch need not have vanished.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Adaptation and tiny eye movements both matter.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Observe first. Infer second. Follow the source.
